<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34004" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμ-βλέπω</span></b> , pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμβέβλοφα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLond.</u>
					1.42.21
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>:—<i>look in the face, look
			at</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὶ τοῖς ὀφθαλμοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Chrm.</u>
					155c
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.69
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. εἰς τὸν ὀφθαλμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Alc.</u>
				</span></i>
			
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1.132e
			</span></i>, etc.: c. acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμβλέπω σε,
			παῖ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				17.7
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Herod.
				2.68
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
				8.25
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				3.11.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1175a9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. εἰς</span>
			<i>consider</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ πετεινὰ τοῦ οὐρανοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
					6.26
				</span></i>
			; <i>look into</i> a matter, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				28.15
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> simply, <i>look</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποῖ ἐμβλέψασα . .
			</span>; <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				995
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεινὸν ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ion</u>
				535e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pyrrh.</u>
				34
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Im.</u>
				1.28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱρὰ ἐς λῷον -οντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herod.
					4.80
				</span></i>
			.</div>
